        <reverseRedeemTypes>29668</reverseRedeemTypes>
        -->
        <!-- CONCORD Spam Prevention Act: contacting (mail, chat/calendar/fleet invites, contact notifications) a
             character who isn't on your contact list costs the ISK they set in the mail settings, paid to CONCORD.
